{"overview":"ماجراهای هیجان‌انگیز آرسان لُپِن سوم، نوهٔ بزرگ‌ترین دزد جهان، آرسان لُپِن را دنبال کنید. با دایسک ژیگن، گوئمن ایشیکاوا و علاقه‌مندی‌اش، فوجیکو ماین، او بزرگ‌ترین دزدی‌های تمام زمان را انجام می‌دهد و در عین حال از کنترل کاوشی زنیگاتا، کارآگاه، فرار می‌کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Follow the exciting adventures of Arsene Lupin III, the grandson of the world's greatest thief, Arsene Lupin. Together with Daisuke Jigen, Goemon Ishikawa and his love interest Fujiko Mine, he carries out the greatest robberies of all time, all the while evading the control of Inspector Koichi Zenigata.","tagline_en":"","runtime":25,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":3,"y":2016,"poster":"/wdHoFaS0WqNRgNvGEIt4KeeGpW0.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":23,"y":1971,"poster":"/6UtnvDW0Ycob5oSUGw07OegJjgk.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":155,"y":1977,"poster":"/rCJrxg9VMUn9Q6a3pqAnJQQvINN.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":50,"y":1984,"poster":"/vQ7YaxqYu5ImCOOBjbOXvhcboGr.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":24,"y":2015,"poster":"/nOu6Ym0SSMV4RYx6yT7S236bfhE.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":24,"y":2018,"poster":"/xzTExP1tzvplgs1LR8C7NGOgtik.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":24,"y":2021,"poster":"/mvths7fKQz8iLYAGDiLk1E5SH2W.jpg"}],"episodes":300,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"栗田貫一","role":"Arsène Lupin III (voice)","photo":"/7XvDPMm6sNspJeZiyfIFBbLRBRI.jpg","en":"Kanichi Kurita"},{"name":"大塚明夫","role":"Daisuke Jigen (voice)","photo":"/uH9oiqOOgrsz2zNnouVZ1qPzDyb.jpg","en":"Akio Otsuka"},{"name":"沢城みゆき","role":"Fujiko Mine (voice)","photo":"/11mGqwpmu8CoEy1YJgabj2g7MIv.jpg","en":"Miyuki Sawashiro"},{"name":"浪川大輔","role":"Goemon Ishikawa XIII (voice)","photo":"/iw0X8oDutxaBAri3Ifga8nhdUJK.jpg","en":"Daisuke Namikawa"},{"name":"کو ایچی یامادرا","role":"Inspector Kōichi Zenigata (voice)","photo":"/biov5jENp2XYfehkcdnRvi796Wi.jpg","en":"Koichi Yamadera"}],"trailer":"46hadBOderc","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31572/watc